% Corrected installer for the deterministic same-process staged pipeline.
%
% Phase rule:
%   cold-path work is allowed ONLY in framework initialization BEFORE
%   real Arming.  Arming / Takeoff / Flight / Landing are protected online
%   phases and are not used as warm-up sinks.
%
